{"title":"Box Of Chocolates","slug":"Box_Of_Chocolates","hero":null,"pageid":3842,"revid":21079,"timestamp":"2026-02-15T17:07:46Z","lastEditor":"Jorgeeeeeeeeeeeee","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Hearty Exchange"},{"label":"Price","value":"$349"},{"label":"Function","value":"Random Chocolates"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.76.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"box-of-chocolates","text":"Box Of Chocolates"},{"id":"possible-items","text":"Possible Items"}],"body":"<blockquote><p><i>\"Life is like a box of chocolates, you never know what you're going to get\"</i></p></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"box-of-chocolates\">Box Of Chocolates</h2>\n<p>The <b>Box of Chocolates</b> is an event item that can be purchased at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hearty_Exchange/\">Hearty Exchange</a> for $349. It is one of 2 items that have a RNG component in the valentines update.\n</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"possible-items\">Possible Items</h2>\n<p>When the player opens the box of chocolates, one of 17 items will spawn:\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"dark-milk-chocolate\">Dark/Milk Chocolate</h3>\n<p>Dark/Milk chocolate figurines have around a 76/77 (98.5%) chance of spawning, making them the majority of chocolates obtained by players. Dark/Milk chocolate figurines can come in the following shapes: <b>cow</b>, <b>rat</b>, <b>grabber</b>, <b>mannequin</b>, <b>cheese</b>, <b>moai</b>, <b>duckie</b>, and <b>gurt</b>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Figurine\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Chance of Obtaining\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Chocolate_Cow/\">Chocolate Cow</a>\n</td>\n<td>N/A<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Chocolate Cow\">Chocolate Cow</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>12.3%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Chocolate_Rat/\">Chocolate Rat</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Chocolaterat\">Chocolaterat</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>N/A\n</td>\n<td>12.3%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Chocolate_Graber/\">Chocolate Grabber</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Chocolategrabber\">Chocolategrabber</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>N/A\n</td>\n<td>12.3%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Chocolate_Mannequin/\">Chocolate Mannequin</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Chocolate Mannequin Clean\">Chocolate Mannequin Clean</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>12.3%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Chocolate_Cheese/\">Chocolate Cheese</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Chocolatecheese\">Chocolatecheese</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Chocolatecheese\">Chocolatecheese</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>N/A\n</td>\n<td>12.3%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Chocolate_Moai/\">Chocolate Moai</a>\n</td>\n<td>N/A<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Chocolatemoai\">Chocolatemoai</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Chocolatemoai\">Chocolatemoai</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>12.3%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Chocolate_Duckie/\">Chocolate Duckie</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Chocolateduckie\">Chocolateduckie</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Chocolateduckie\">Chocolateduckie</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>N/A\n</td>\n<td>12.3%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Chocolate_Gurt/\">Chocolate Gurt</a>\n</td>\n<td>N/A<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Chocolategurt\">Chocolategurt</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Chocolategurt\">Chocolategurt</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>12.3%\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><b>Chance of Obtaining</b> represents the total odds of getting a single type of chocolate figurine each time a box of chocolates is opened.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"white-chocolate\">White Chocolate</h3>\n<p>White chocolate figurines have a 1/77 (1.3%) chance of spawning, making them much rarer than their dark/milk chocolate counterparts. White chocolate figurines can come in the same shapes as dark/milk chocolate: <b>cow</b>, <b>rat</b>, <b>grabber</b>, <b>mannequin</b>, <b>cheese</b>, <b>moai</b>, <b>duckie</b>, and <b>gurt</b>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<t