span title=\"White Chocolate Moai (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2hpdGVfQ2hvY29sYXRlX01vYWk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">White Chocolate Moai</span>\n</td>\n<td>N/A\n</td>\n<td>0.163%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/White_Chocolate_Duckie/\">White Chocolate Duckie</a>\n</td>\n<td>N/A<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Whitechocolateduckie\">Whitechocolateduckie</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Whitechocolateduckie\">Whitechocolateduckie</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>0.163%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span title=\"White Chocolate Gurt (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2hpdGVfQ2hvY29sYXRlX0d1cnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">White Chocolate Gurt</span>\n</td>\n<td>N/A\n</td>\n<td>0.163%\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><b>Chance of Obtaining</b> represents the total odds of getting a single type of chocolate figurine each time a box of chocolates is opened.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"special\">Special</h3>\n<p>A model of grUdge has a 1/777 (0.129%) chance of spawning, making it the rarest and most expensive item to obtain.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Figurine\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Chance of Obtaining\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/GrUdge/\">grUdge</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: GrUdge2\">GrUdge2</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: GrUdge2\">GrUdge2</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>N/A\n</td>\n<td>0.129%\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><b>Chance of Obtaining</b> represents the total odds of getting a single type of chocolate figurine each time a box of chocolates is opened. \n</p>"}
